    "type": "DOCUMENT",
    "description": "Sách, tài liệu theo syllabus.",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CPV301 · Materials</span>\n<h2>Books & materials</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Buy or borrow the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed. Materials with no author/ISBN are internal FPT files (download them inside FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CPV301 · Tài liệu</span>\n<h2>Sách & tài liệu</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Mua/mượn đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng. Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN là tệp nội bộ của FPT (tải trong FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Computer Vision: A Modern Approach</strong></p><p>David Forsyth, Jean Ponce · Pearson · 10/26/2011 12:00:00 AM · 2nd · ISBN <code>978-0136085928</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Computer Vision: Algorithms and Applications</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Richard Szeliski · Springer · 10/19/2010 12:00:00 AM · 1st · ISBN <code>978-1848829343</code></p><p><a href=\"https://szeliski.org/Book/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://szeliski.org/Book/</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Course slide</strong></p><p></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Labs &amp; assignment</strong></p><p></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Multiple View Geometry in Computer Vision</strong></p><p>Richard Hartley · Cambridge University Press · 4/19/2004 12:00:00 AM · 2nd · ISBN <code>978-0521540513</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>OpenCV Computer Vision with Python</strong></p><p>Joseph Howse · Packt · 4/1/2013 12:00:00 AM · 1st · ISBN <code>978-1782163923</code></p></div>"
